title: "Breaking Your Fixed Mortgage: 3 Months' Interest vs. the IRD"
description: "If you break a fixed-rate mortgage early, your penalty is usually the greater of three months' interest or the IRD. Here's how each works and how to keep the cost down."
publishDate: 2026-11-18
